# bench outputs. One directory per run under bench/runs/<dataset>/<pipeline>/, replaced
# each time that pair is run. The summary is small and tracked on purpose -- it records
# what was run and what it scored, so both are a diff. The per-item rows and the event
# stream are neither small nor comparable line by line, so they stay local.
bench/runs/*/*/*
!bench/runs/*/*/summary.json
# SeamlessStreaming runs outside bench (bench/seamless/). Exported audio, synthesized
# speech and per-item rows stay local; the scored summaries are copied to results/.
bench/seamless/work/

# Benchmark datasets live in their own repo (github.com/STiTy-team/datasets),
# checked out wherever STITY_DATA_ROOT points. Nothing dataset-shaped belongs here.
/datasets/

# Configs live in S3 (stity/configs/); configs/ holds a local copy kept by make configs-pull / configs-push.
/configs/pipelines/
/configs/datasets/
/configs/.synced.json
# Presentation decks and proposal drafts (binary, local only)
/assets/slides/

# en2x CoVoST2 분절 조건별 채점 산출물 (full_* 하나가 60~450MB, bleu*/*.json 이 대부분).
# 위 CoVoST2 규칙과 같은 방침으로 결과 요약(*.md)만 추적한다. 기준선 full/ 은 이 규칙에 걸리지 않는다.
core/meaning_segmentator/experiment/artifacts/en2x/covost2/full_*/**
